[I] ELF related utils for ELF 32/64 binaries

[T] A suite of ELF tools to aid auditing systems. Contains various ELF related
[T] utils for ELF32, ELF64 binaries useful for displaying PaX and security info
[T] on a large groups of binary files.

[U] https://wiki.gentoo.org/wiki/Hardened/PaX_Utilities

